o/news/all-in-one-creativity-kapwing-partners-with-minimax-ai"}]}]}</script><main class="flex flex-col items-center w-full overflow-y-auto flex-1 pb-[160px] min-h-screen"><div class="px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[1000px] flex flex-col items-center mt-[80px]"><div class="text-brand-1 text-[14px] font-[400] leading-[21px] mb-[24px]">Sept. 11 ,2025</div><h1 class="m-0 p-0 text-center text-brand-1 text-[54px] font-[500] leading-[86.4px] pb-[36px]">All-in-One Creativity: Kapwing Partners with MiniMax AI</h1></div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] m-0 p-0 text-brand-1 text-[16px] font-[300] leading-[28.8px] [&amp;&gt;strong]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;b]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;a]:text-col-brand-00 [&amp;&gt;a]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;a:hover]:underline">  <p>We’re excited to announce a new partnership between <strong>Kapwing</strong> and <strong>MiniMax AI</strong>. With the integration of MiniMax’s cutting-edge models, Kapwing now empowers creators with next-generation video generation capabilities, all within its all-in-one <a href="https://www.kapwing.com/ai-video-generator"target="_blank">AI studio</a>.</p>

    
 </div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] py-[48px]"><div class="flex justify-center"><div class="relative max-w-full overflow-hidden" style="width:768px;height:403.20000000000005px"><img alt="" fetchPriority="high" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="rounded-[12px] object-contain object-top" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fe9164636-bd1f-4735-bbf1-9bde2fe1ee96.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fe9164636-bd1f-4735-bbf1-9bde2fe1ee96.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fe9164636-bd1f-4735-bbf1-9bde2fe1ee96.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fe9164636-bd1f-4735-bbf1-9bde2fe1ee96.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fe9164636-bd1f-4735-bbf1-9bde2fe1ee96.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fe9164636-bd1f-4735-bbf1-9bde2fe1ee96.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fe9164636-bd1f-4735-bbf1-9bde2fe1ee96.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fe9164636-bd1f-4735-bbf1-9bde2fe1ee96.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2Fe9164636-bd1f-4735-bbf1-9bde2fe1ee96.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] m-0 p-0 text-brand-1 text-[16px] font-[300] leading-[28.8px] [&amp;&gt;strong]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;b]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;a]:text-col-brand-00 [&amp;&gt;a]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;a:hover]:underline">  <p>Kapwing has long been known as a versatile online video editor that supports a powerful, non-linear editing workflow. You can upload images, audio, and video, and edit everything together in one place. Now, with the addition of MiniMax’s AI models, creators can take their projects even further, combining seamless editing with high-quality AI generation.</p>

    <h3>Models You Can Use Directly on Kapwing</h3>

    <p>There are two flagship models now available in Kapwing:</p>

    <ul>
        <li><strong>Hailuo-02</strong>, Generate 6s and 10s clips in 512p, 768p, or 1080p. This is the model behind viral content such as <em>“Animal Olympics”</em> since its launch.</li>
        <li><strong>MiniMax-Music,</strong> designed for control, musicality, and creativity. Allows creators to make full-length tracks with complete structure.</li>
    </ul>
</div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] py-[48px]"><div class="flex justify-center"><div class="relative max-w-full overflow-hidden" style="width:768px;height:396.67199999999997px"><img alt="" fetchPriority="high" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="rounded-[12px] object-contain object-top" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F3aa838e2-84ee-4fe5-a01c-09ab766e725d.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F3aa838e2-84ee-4fe5-a01c-09ab766e725d.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F3aa838e2-84ee-4fe5-a01c-09ab766e725d.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F3aa838e2-84ee-4fe5-a01c-09ab766e725d.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F3aa838e2-84ee-4fe5-a01c-09ab766e725d.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F3aa838e2-84ee-4fe5-a01c-09ab766e725d.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F3aa838e2-84ee-4fe5-a01c-09ab766e725d.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F3aa838e2-84ee-4fe5-a01c-09ab766e725d.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffilecdn.minimax.chat%2Fpublic%2F3aa838e2-84ee-4fe5-a01c-09ab766e725d.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div><div class="w-full px-[20px] lg:px-0 lg:w-[768px] m-0 p-0 text-brand-1 text-[16px] font-[300] leading-[28.8px] [&amp;&gt;strong]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;b]:font-[500] [&amp;&gt;a]:text-col-brand-00 [&amp;&gt;a]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;a:hover]:underline"> <h3>How to Use It</h3>

    <p>You can now generate studio-grade videos with MiniMax models in just a few clicks:</p>

    <ol>
        <li>Open the “<strong>Video Clips”</strong> tab in the <a href="https://www.kapwing.com/studio/editor/ai-tools"target="_blank">Kapwing AI Toolkit</a>.</li>
        <li>Choose <strong>MiniMax Hailuo-2</strong> as your model.</li>
        <li>Enter a text or image prompt and watch your video come to life.</li>
        <li>Refine your clip with Kapwing’s full creative suite — add subtitles, brand elements, voice over, and more.</li>
    </ol>

    <h3>Step into the Next Era of Video Creation</h3>

    <p>AI video generation has already reshaped the creative industry, unlocking new levels of imagination and productivity. At MiniMax, our mission is to empower creators to work smarter, faster, and more creatively.</p>

    <p><a href="https://www.kapwing.com/blog/kapwing-partners-with-minimax-to-power-advanced-ai-video-models/"target="_blank">Thanks to this integration</a>, Kapwing users can now complete their <strong>entire video workflow in one place.</strong> No downloads, no tool switching, just seamless creation from <strong>prompt to publish</strong>.</p>

</body>
