io/#website\",\"url\":\"https://www.minimax.io\",\"name\":\"MiniMax\",\"description\":\"Building AGI with our mission Intelligence with Everyone. Global leader in multi-modal models and AI-native products with over 200 million users.\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.minimax.io/#organization\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https://www.minimax.io/news\"}}},{\"@type\":\"NewsArticle\",\"@id\":\"https://www.minimax.io/news/all-in-one-creativity-kapwing-partners-with-minimax-ai#article\",\"headline\":\"All-in-One Creativity: Kapwing Partners with MiniMax AI\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":[],\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.minimax.io/#organization\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.minimax.io/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://www.minimax.io/news/all-in-one-creativity-kapwing-partners-with-minimax-ai\"},\"articleSection\":\"News\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"isAccessibleForFree\":true,\"copyrightYear\":2026,\"copyrightHolder\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.minimax.io/#organization\"}},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://www.minimax.io/news/all-in-one-creativity-kapwing-partners-with-minimax-ai#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.minimax.io\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"What's New\",\"item\":\"https://www.minimax.io/news\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"All-in-One Creativity: Kapwing Partners with MiniMax AI\",\"item\":\"https://www.minimax.io/news/all-in-one-creativity-kapwing-partners-with-minimax-ai\"}]}]}"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1b:T4d1, \u003ch3\u003eHow to Use It\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n    \u003cp\u003eYou can now generate studio-grade videos with MiniMax models in just a few clicks:\u003c/p\u003e\n\n    \u003col\u003e\n        \u003cli\u003eOpen the “\u003cstrong\u003eVideo Clips”\u003c/strong\u003e tab in the \u003ca href=\"https://www.kapwing.com/studio/editor/ai-tools\"target=\"_blank\"\u003eKapwing AI Toolkit\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\n        \u003cli\u003eChoose \u003cstrong\u003eMiniMax Hailuo-2\u003c/strong\u003e as your model.\u003c/li\u003e\n        \u003cli\u003eEnter a text or image prompt and watch your video come to life.\u003c/li\u003e\n        \u003cli\u003eRefine your clip with Kapwing’s full creative suite — add subtitles, brand elements, voice over, and more.\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003c/ol\u003e\n\n    \u003ch3\u003eStep into the Next Era of Video Creation\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n    \u003cp\u003eAI video generation has already reshaped the creative industry, unlocking new levels of imagination and productivity. At MiniMax, our mission is to empower creators to work smarter, faster, and more creatively.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n    \u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.kapwing.com/blog/kapwing-partners-with-minimax-to-power-advanced-ai-video-models/\"target=\"_blank\"\u003eThanks to this integration\u003c/a\u003e, Kapwing users can now complete their \u003cstrong\u003eentire video workflow in one place.\u003c/strong\u003e No downloads, no tool switching, just seamless creation from \u003cstrong\u003eprompt to publish\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"7:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$19\"}}],[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"data\":{\"base_resp\":{\"status_code\":0,\"status_msg\":\"success\"},\"title\":\"All-in-One Creativity: Kapwing Partners with MiniMax AI\",\"content\":[{\"id\":\"eccd576f-748a-47fc-906a-3e74b4333059\",\"type\":\"ArticleTitle\",\"props\":{\"date\":\"Sept. 11 ,2025\",\"title\":\"All-in-One Creativity: Kapwing Partners with MiniMax AI\"},\"children\":[]},{\"id\":\"27c4cbff-418c-4927-a023-32bca898fe37\",\"type\":\"ArticleParagraph\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"  \u003cp\u003eWe’re excited to announce a new partnership between \u003cstrong\u003eKapwing\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eMiniMax AI\u003c/strong\u003e. With the integration of MiniMax’s cutting-edge models, Kapwing now empowers creators with next-generation video generation capabilities, all within its all-in-one \u003ca href=\\\"https://www.kapwing.com/ai-video-generator\\\"target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003eAI studio\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\\n    \\n \"},\"children\":[]},{\"id\":\"b4fff138-e8b9-4f37-a014-08c3a9578cd9\",\"type\":\"ArticleImage\",\"props\":{\"src\":\"https://filecdn.minimax.chat/public/e9164636-bd1f-4735-bbf1-9bde2fe1ee96.png\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:2.1\"},\"children\":[]},{\"id\":\"f3d9736f-d026-4056-a6b9-6759b30d73a2\",\"type\":\"ArticleParagraph\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"  \u003cp\u003eKapwing has long been known as a versatile online video editor that supports a powerful, non-linear editing workflow. You can upload images, audio, and video, and edit everything together in one place. Now, with the addition of MiniMax’s AI models, creators can take their projects even further, combining seamless editing with high-quality AI generation.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\\n    \u003ch3\u003eModels You Can Use Directly on Kapwing\u003c/h3\u003e\\n\\n    \u003cp\u003eThere are two flagship models now available in Kapwing:\u003c/p\u003e\\n\\n    \u003cul\u003e\\n        \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHailuo-02\u003c/strong\u003e, Generate 6s and 10s clips in 512p, 768p, or 1080p. This is the model behind viral content such as \u003cem\u003e“Animal Olympics”\u003c/em\u003e since its launch.\u003c/li\u003e\\n        \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMiniMax-Music,\u003c/strong\u003e designed for control, musicality, and creativity. Allows creators to make full-length tracks with complete structure.\u003c/li\u003e\\n    \u003c/ul\u003e\\n\"},\"children\":[]},{\"id\":\"eca47783-4bfc-4648-b715-23d5e4e59b93\",\"type\":\"ArticleImage\",\"props\":{\"src\":\"https://filecdn.minimax.chat/public/3aa838e2-84ee-4fe5-a01c-09ab766e725d.jpg\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:2.066\"},\"children\":[]},{\"id\":\"165dbb76-0849-4d5d-b42c-497ed614e5a5\",\"type\":\"ArticleParagraph\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"$1b\"},\"children\":[]}],\"slug\":\"all-in-one-creativity-kapwing-partners-with-minimax-ai\"}}]]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"c:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=5\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"theme-color\",\"content\":\"#181E25\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"2\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"title\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"All-in-One Creativity: Kapwing Partners with MiniMax AI - MiniMax News | MiniMax\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"name\":\"application-name\",\"content\":\"MiniMax\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"name\":\"author\",\"content\":\"MiniMax\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"name\":\"generator\",\"content\":\"Next.js\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"name\":\"referrer\",\"content\":\"origin-when-cross-origin\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"name\":\"creator\",\"content\":\"MiniMax\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"name\":\"publisher\",\"content\":\"MiniMax\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"name\":\"robots\",\"content\":\"index, follow\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"11\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://www.minimax.io/news/all-in-one-creativity-kapwing-partners-with-minimax-ai\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"12\",{\"rel\":\"alternate\",\"hrefLang\":\"zh\",\"href\":\"https://www.minimax.cn/news/all-in-one-creativity-kapwing-partners-with-minimax-ai\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"13\",{\"rel\":\"alternate\",\"hrefLang\":\"en\",\"href\":\"https://www.minimax.io/news/all-in-one-creativity-kapwing-partners-with-minimax-ai\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"14\",{\"rel\":\"alternate\",\"hrefLang\":\"x-default\",\"href\":\"https://www.minimax.io/news/all-in-one-creativity-kapwing-partners-with-minimax-ai\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"15\",{\"name\":\"format-detection\",\"content\":\"telephone=no, address=no, email=no\"}],[\"$\",\"meta